{"resourceIdentifier":"2614","resourceName":"Lingbi County Wastewater Treatment Plant Project","description":"Lingbi County wastewater treatment project is located in Suzhou City, Anhui Province, China. The whole aerobic process includes pre-treatment process,secondary biological treatment process, tertiary deep treatment process and sludge treatment process, with a maximum design influent flow of 120,000 m3/d, the influent and effluent COD concentration are 850 mg/L and 50 mg/L separately.\r\nIn the baseline scenario, village sewage and some industrial wastewater from the county would have been treated through a series of deep open anaerobic lagoons. The open lagoons are the best available low-cost solution for wastewater treatment, which is also in compliance with the environmental regulations. In the project scenario, the wastewater will be treated through aerobic biological treatment technology, which includes pre-treatment process, secondary biological treatment process, tertiary deep treatment process and sludge treatment process.\r\nEmission reductions are generated by reducing methane emissions of the open anaerobic lagoons in baseline scenario. Annual average estimation of GHG emission reductions from the project activity is 67,302 tCO2e/year,","location":{"latitude":33.611111,"longitude":117.558554},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-10-21","endExclusive":"2021-11-21","endInclusive":"2021-11-20"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2614"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Anhui Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Lingbi Chenxin Green Industry Development Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Anhui, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 17721294832"},{"type":"string","value":"lifetourforever1993@gmail.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"